WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.632 --> 00:00:01.804
PETER QUILL
I look around at us...

00:00:03.531 --> 00:00:04.398
You know what I see?

00:00:05.658 --> 00:00:06.499
Family.

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:07.436
MANTIS
I love you all.

00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:10.976
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
It's time.

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:14.195
DRAX
Yeah!

00:00:17.242 --> 00:00:18.796
PETER QUILL
It's the end of the road, Guardians.

00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:19.585
MANTIS
That is sad.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.531
PETER QUILL
You know what's sad? People on Earth

00:00:21.582 --> 00:00:22.632
die when they're like 50.

00:00:22.683 --> 00:00:24.101
MANTIS
Are you about to die?

00:00:24.152 --> 00:00:25.210
PETER QUILL
I'm not 50!

